# Directories Bazel must not descend into at all.
#
# The external-consumer example is a separate Bazel repository, built against a
# packaged archive by tools/test_candace_external_consumer.sh in the monorepo.
# Its BUILD files resolve `@candace` to that archive, so they are not packages
# of this module and Bazel reading them as such would be wrong twice over.
examples/external-consumer/_workspace

# Node dependencies installed by the gotth benchmark harness. Untracked, huge,
# and not an input to any Bazel target.
pkg/gotth/bench/node_modules
